dent:** INC-0001 is open as a SEV3 against checkout-api. It records the deploy, the approval and the health check after the deploy. Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking checkout-api's release history and current status.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PsYkfwyHm4CqhrRAdNY4Us", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MUF5c4sHcwHbhPoAN9LcmY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "v2.3.2 has never run in production, so it has never been healthy there. Under policy, that means the deploy needs change-manager approval. I'm submitting it now so it can be routed to them.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01LiKwZkASxvhz8tRdce6uEu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.2", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "deploy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FUDLPmP5Q4FVyZ5PjYJdd3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Vpfi5G7wQRMt1wUbpUvuAr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Pqe1KPqhWjwJCJcgoDa8cr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api hotfix v2.3.2 deployed to production", "severity": "SEV3", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "Deployed hotfix v2.3.2 to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), replacing unhealthy v2.3.1 (error rate 18%). Change-manager approval obtained because v2.3.2 had no prior healthy production history. Post-deploy: service healthy, error rate 0.2%.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.2-deploy-record", "confidence": 0.92}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I shipped hotfix v2.3.2 to all production regions and opened a SEV3 incident recording the change.\n\n**Deploy:** checkout-api v2.3.2 is now live in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Approval:** v2.3.2 had never run in production, so policy required change-manager approval. They approved it before the rollout went ahead.\n- **Result:** It replaced v2.3.1, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate. After the deploy the service is healthy and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** INC-0001 is open as a SEV3 against checkout-api. It records the deploy, the approval and the health check after the deploy. Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}